msgstr "Report-only is on: the policy goes out as Content-Security-Policy-Report-Only, so violations are reported and nothing is blocked. Turn it off to enforce."

msgid "settings.headers.notice.hsts_preload"
msgstr "This value contains preload. Once the domain is submitted to the browsers' preload list, removal takes months to reach users -- every subdomain is HTTPS-only until then."

msgid "settings.headers.notice.keep_all"
msgstr "The keep list is *, so every header the upstream sends wins over the values configured here."

msgid "settings.headers.notice.keep_shadows"
msgstr "These headers are kept from the upstream when it sends its own, so the values configured here are only a fallback:"

